WEBVTT

00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:11.690
Oh, Tsutsumi! Good morning!

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:12.620
Hey.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:16.970
You're late today.

00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:17.810
I guess.

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:21.930
Got ya!

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:23.750
Arrest the criminal!

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:27.260
Ayase Hanabi's two-timing caught live!

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:33.050
I didn't think she was someone like that. I was shocked!

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:36.370
Hey wait! What is this about two-timing?

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:38.990
Stop acting dumb! We have evidence!

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:44.480
I gave this profile sheet to Tsutsumi.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:45.930
The person I like is...

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:47.290
Eh!?

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:52.380
Ayase Hanabi, age 12.

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:55.520
I've been accused of being a two-timer!

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:51.200
Two-timer! Two-timer! Two-timer!

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:54.330
No way! This must have been a mistake!

00:02:55.830 --> 00:02:58.590
What is this about two-timing?

00:02:58.590 --> 00:02:59.520
Takao!

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:01.810
Oh crap! The husband's here!

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:03.870
This is a warzone!

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:07.510
I thought you weren't someone like that, Ayase.

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:11.140
I'm not two-timing or anything like that!

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:12.120
Oh?

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:13.800
It's true!

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:16.300
You're my only boyfriend, Takao!

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:19.300
I'm sure of it!

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:21.800
I only like you, Takao!

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:24.460
I love you so much! You're number one in the world!

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:26.750
In the world?

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:32.220
You're doing this on purpose, aren't you?

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:35.540
I'm sorry. I wanted to make sure.

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:40.120
I guess that's the end of it. Disband, team.

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:42.650
Wow, how boring.

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:47.420
I didn't write that on my sheet!

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:52.110
"It must feel terrible to be dumped."

00:03:52.110 --> 00:03:53.750
"Let's go drink away your sorrows."

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.060
Yeah, right!

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:57.420
Who wrote that!?

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:00.510
Oh, so it was a prank.

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:03.190
But it surprised me a bit!

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:07.820
Of course it was a prank!

00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:10.460
It should be "The one I dislike."

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:18.500
I guess you can't become friends with a boy like you can with a girl...

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:28.650
Hey, Tsutsumi.

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:33.580
What kind of presents do boys like?

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.060
I don't know. Go ask Takao.

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:39.520
He's teasing Hanabi again.

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:44.800
Why is he teasing the one he likes? I guess he's still a brat.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.770
Huh? I thought I said that was a mistake!

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.640
Oh dear.

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:52.800
A present? For Takao?

00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:57.940
Yeah. I don't know what to give him on his birthday.

00:04:57.940 --> 00:05:01.630
Oh!? Takao's birthday is coming up?

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:05.180
He told me about it...

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:06.140
Yeah, yeah.

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:08.060
But the date has passed already.

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:10.160
Eh!?

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:12.550
That's quite a shock.

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:15.470
It's one of a couple's big events!

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:20.420
But I told him that we should celebrate even if it's a bit late.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:23.000
We're going on a date this Sunday!

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:25.150
How nice!

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:29.660
I want to surprise him with a present.

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:31.390
I see.

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:34.660
My sister gave her boyfriend matching mugs.

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:37.160
And handmade cookies!

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:40.950
Handmade cookies! I wonder if he'll like them.

00:05:41.530 --> 00:05:42.610
Eww.

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:47.470
He'll definitely get an upset stomach if he eats them.

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:48.830
Do you want to kill Takao?

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:50.880
That's not true!

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:55.230
He ate the crepe I made during home economics class!

00:05:57.030 --> 00:05:58.810
Hey, are you okay with that?

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:00.750
With what?

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:02.010
Just look.

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:03.640
Where are you going for your date?

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:04.490
Tokyo!

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:06.710
How nice!

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:07.740
Jeez, you're quite confident.

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:10.400
So there'll be lots of people!

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:14.820
I'm so worried! Be careful not to get lost, Hanabi.

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:17.020
I'm so excited!

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:19.680
What's with this?

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:29.380
Tsutsumi is actually a bit childish.

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:33.960
He's normally all cool but with Hanabi he changes.

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:39.150
I want to get along with him since we're in the same class.

00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:43.290
Let's see how they turned out.

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:50.020
That's my Yui! You're so good at baking!

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:51.280
Really?

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:53.810
Yeah! They look like the ones in the stores!

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:57.830
I think I should give some to Hiyama, too.

00:06:57.830 --> 00:06:59.460
Great idea!

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:02.040
Compared to hers, mine are...

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:05.920
Well, I guess you can call them unique?

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:08.280
I shouldn't give these to him.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:09.590
Don't worry!

00:07:09.590 --> 00:07:13.750
What's important is wanting Takao to be happy!

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:15.590
Yui!

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:19.990
All that's left is wrapping them up all cute!

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:22.370
Show them your feminine charms!

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:41.190
Um, here you go.

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:45.400
These turned out pretty good, so I want you to have some.

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:46.420
Okay...

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:50.540
Thanks!

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:03.930
That's great, Yui!

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:08.750
Yeah! I hope you can give yours to Takao this Sunday!

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:11.160
About that...

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:12.370
What's the matter?

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:21.070
I've been thinking about also giving him something permanent.

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:22.840
Something permanent?

00:08:22.840 --> 00:08:28.590
Yeah, this is his first birthday after going out with me.

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:33.150
I want to give him something to celebrate us becoming a couple!

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:39.630
Birthdays are very important days!

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:42.710
It's the day that the person I love was born!

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:46.050
I know that feeling.

00:08:46.050 --> 00:08:47.970
Thank you, Yui!

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:53.630
I knew this would happen, so I researched a lot!

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:55.290
Miss Marin!

00:08:55.290 --> 00:09:02.790
According to my sister, these are the three top things boys want for their birthday.

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:04.660
One, wallet!

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:06.020
Wallet!

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:08.070
Two, watch!

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:09.620
Watch!

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:11.440
Three, cologne.

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:12.890
Cologne!?

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:21.820
Wow! Cologne!

00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:23.710
That's too mature!

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:25.110
Those are all terrible.

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:29.460
Let me ask you something. Do you have the money?

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:35.140
Well, I guess those are geared towards high schoolers.

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:38.320
Oh well. Let me help you choose.

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:41.030
You'll go shopping with me!?

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:43.230
What a turn of events!

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:45.750
I think he'll pick something fancy!

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:50.290
That's great, Hanabi.

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:51.550
Yeah!

00:09:51.550 --> 00:09:54.240
Ayase Hanabi, age 12.

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:58.260
I'm going to give my beloved boyfriend his first present!

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:20.610
Thank you!

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:30.610
Good morning, Tsutsumi.

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:34.960
W-What's with that getup?

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:43.540
Since I have a date with Takao today, Marin helped me dress up.

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:44.680
How does it look?

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:49.710
It doesn't fit you at all!

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.950
Eh!?

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:54.100
We're going to buy a present, right?

00:10:54.100 --> 00:10:55.080
Let's go.

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:57.660
Okay!

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:02.700
Just you wait. I'll pick something that will disgust Takao.

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:05.420
So you wear a watch, Tsutsumi.

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:09.340
Can you tell me when it gets close to 1 PM?

00:11:09.340 --> 00:11:11.590
I need to meet up with Takao.

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:15.610
I don't have a cell phone so I can't tell the time.

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:18.020
Oh, got it.

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:39.450
So your boyfriend is Takao?

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:42.700
Takao is his last name.

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:44.200
Sounds nice!

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:46.810
All this talk about Takao is giving me a headache.

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:47.980
Did you say something?

00:11:47.980 --> 00:11:48.800
Nothing.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:11:59.600
I'm going now.

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:07.730
Thank goodness you're with me, Tsutsumi.

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:09.880
Your sense in style is worrisome.

00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:11.890
I guess.

00:12:11.890 --> 00:12:14.540
With you I think we can find a wonderful present.

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:15.660
Thank you!

00:12:15.850 --> 00:12:19.630
Really? I was thinking about getting out of here fast.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:21.810
But if you really like being with me that much...

00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:23.470
I can stay a bit longer...

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:25.290
Yes?

00:12:28.090 --> 00:12:28.750
Let's go!

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:34.660
Eh? Tsutsumi? Are you angry?

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:36.440
Welcome!

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:39.870
One Quarter Pounder with a side of fries.

00:12:39.870 --> 00:12:42.260
Also an apple pie and iced coffee without ice.

00:12:42.260 --> 00:12:43.190
What about you, Hanabi?

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:47.780
Why are you just standing there?

00:12:48.480 --> 00:12:53.760
I've never ordered by myself before... What should I get?

00:12:53.760 --> 00:12:55.400
Isn't this line a bit slow?

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:57.920
You should decide before lining up.

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:00.980
Is there anything you don't like?

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:03.060
Not really.

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:04.140
I got it.

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:06.660
Give me another Quarter Pounder set.

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:07.880
Make the drink a coke.

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:11.500
It's cheap and delicious.

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:13.140
You're amazing, Tsutsumi.

00:13:13.740 --> 00:13:15.570
So cool!

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:20.550
It's normal.

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:26.090
That's not true!

00:13:26.090 --> 00:13:28.070
You can order a burger set by yourself!

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:30.320
You walk so casually, too!

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:32.090
I look up to you!

00:13:32.090 --> 00:13:34.900
It's really nothing. I come every week.

00:13:34.900 --> 00:13:36.960
Every week? By yourself?

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:37.700
I guess.

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:39.060
Wow!

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:42.610
I take classes at the dance school nearby.

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:45.980
Really? That's why you're so good at dancing.

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:48.830
It's on your face.

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:50.790
Thank you.

00:13:58.530 --> 00:13:59.420
Ayase...

00:14:01.710 --> 00:14:05.360
Hey! Those are my fries.

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:07.200
It's only a few.

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:09.070
Not just fries!

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:14.710
You took my strawberry, my fried chicken, and my pudding in kindergarten!

00:14:14.710 --> 00:14:16.620
You sure remember a lot.

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:19.690
Okay, okay. I'll give you my apple pie.

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:23.380
This is delicious!

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.300
Talk after you swallow.

00:14:28.870 --> 00:14:31.160
What? What's so funny?

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:32.470
This is so fun!

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:33.270
Huh?

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:35.510
Are you not having fun, Tsutsumi?

00:14:35.510 --> 00:14:37.540
Oh, I guess.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:38.850
That's great!

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:41.280
You've changed, Tsutsumi.

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:47.670
You were a scary Emperor before, but now you're different.

00:14:47.670 --> 00:14:51.660
You even went shopping with me, so you do have a kind side.

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:54.610
So different from before.

00:14:56.850 --> 00:15:01.830
I should have met you sooner, so we can become friends earlier.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:04.070
What a shame.

00:15:08.750 --> 00:15:17.280
The Hanabi in my memories is always crying.

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:07.280
I've never seen Hanabi like this...

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:11.210
...with such a happy smile.

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:23.710
I'm over here.

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:29.420
If only I realized sooner...

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:32.550
If only I was nicer...

00:16:36.060 --> 00:16:40.430
The one by her side may have been me.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:01.040
Where did you go, Ayase?

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:05.300
Huh? Tsutsumi, are we okay with time?

00:17:07.100 --> 00:17:07.990
Yeah.

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:13.900
Um, I should get going soon.

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:23.600
I won't let you go.

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:28.390
Tsutsumi?

00:17:28.390 --> 00:17:29.050
Ayase!

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:39.870
Huh? Takao! Why are you...

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:45.480
Tsutsumi! Hey, what's the matter all of a sudden?

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:49.730
Tsutsumi! Tsutsumi!

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:57.210
Tsutsumi, why are you doing this?

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:04.440
I don't think of you as my friend!

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:11.450
I... For a while now...

00:18:13.970 --> 00:18:18.410
Tsutsumi, what's the meaning of this?

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:23.140
Takao!

00:18:29.730 --> 00:18:33.000
Takao, Tsutsumi didn't do anything wrong.

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:39.640
He's just helping me shop and we didn't realize how much time has passed...

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:41.350
Right, Tsutsumi?

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:43.310
I knew.

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:49.150
I knew that you were late.

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:53.270
I wanted to make you miss your appointment, so I didn't tell you.

00:18:54.390 --> 00:18:57.190
You did it on purpose?

00:19:01.590 --> 00:19:03.600
Let's go, Ayase.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:05.400
Okay.

00:19:09.770 --> 00:19:11.360
Stupid Hanabi.

00:19:12.010 --> 00:19:14.300
Stop covering for me.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:21.920
I just didn't want you to go to Takao's side.

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:43.620
Takao was worried about me and ran all over the place.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:54.020
I'm sorry for today.

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:57.200
I was the one who wanted to celebrate, too.

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:59.160
That's fine now.

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:00.560
But...

00:20:00.870 --> 00:20:01.850
Then...

00:20:03.910 --> 00:20:07.860
I'm quite mad that you were with Tsutsumi secretly.

00:20:07.860 --> 00:20:09.210
Lower your head.

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:13.650
Takao is actually really angry!

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:17.980
Um, I'm really, really sorry about today!

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:24.830
Ayase, you've been thinking about me this entire time that you've forgotten about your own birthday.

00:20:32.630 --> 00:20:34.950
Happy 12th birthday!

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:54.910
Of course you can't stay friends forever.

00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:58.420
What are you talking about?

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:03.000
I won't ever let you go.

00:22:50.340 --> 00:22:53.660
Wow, that's so cute!

00:22:53.660 --> 00:22:57.160
As expected from Takao, he knows how to woo a girl.

00:22:58.030 --> 00:23:01.110
So what did you give Takao?

00:23:01.110 --> 00:23:02.980
Um...

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:05.600
Didn't you go shopping with Tsutsumi?

00:23:05.930 --> 00:23:07.190
Well...

00:23:07.870 --> 00:23:10.440
Good morning, Tsutsumi.

00:23:13.240 --> 00:23:15.390
Tsutsumi, good...

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:23.650
Ayase Hanabi, age 12.

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:27.430
I think I made Tsutsumi mad.

00:23:27.780 --> 00:23:30.070
But why?

00:23:40.310 --> 00:23:44.850
Hanabi, I don't think of you as my friend.

00:23:44.850 --> 00:23:47.160
I can't hold these feelings inside anymore.

00:23:47.160 --> 00:23:48.940
I will make you mine!

00:23:48.940 --> 00:23:50.290
Hey, Takao!

00:23:50.290 --> 00:23:52.260
Let's have a fight for Hanabi!

00:23:52.260 --> 00:23:55.530
I will make your heart throb!
